# Mihgo's Amigo (windurst 25): its lines next to other containers' lines (the reply kinds). A level-10 WAR with Hitting
# the Marquisate accepted by GM at nanaaProg 1: its 517 (Progress, no finish handler) answers at Nanaa Mihgo on every
# talk. Ties rotate by the last event id (interaction_lookup.lua performNextAction); with none, the first action in the
# list plays, here Mihgo's Amigo's. Available: 80 ties with 517 and plays first,
# begun. Accepted: 82 (an Event) loses to 517. Four necklaces: 88 (the only trade line), completed. Completed, no
# mustZone: 517. Four necklaces again: 494, the mustZone. 89 (an Event) loses to 517. Back to available by GM, Crying
# Over Onions accepted: 81 ties with 517; 517 played last, so 81 plays. As Thick as Thieves accepted by GM (Mihgo's
# Amigo accepted): Cha Lebagta's 85 (an Event) loses to its 507 (Progress).
lists WindurstWoods/Nanaa_Mihgo/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Nanaa_Mihgo/onTrade WindurstWoods/Cha_Lebagta/onTrigger
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=66.5,-4.75,239.6 job=WAR lvl=10
quest Windurst.HittingTheMarquisate accepted
charvar Quest[2][71]nanaaProg 1
item YagudoBeadNecklace x8
login
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # available: 80 and 517 tie (Progress); no last id: 80
finish                                         # begun
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # accepted: 82 (Event) under 517 (Progress): 517
finish
trade Nanaa_Mihgo+99 YagudoBeadNecklace x4     # 88 (200)
finish                                         # completed
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # completed, no mustZone: 517
finish
trade Nanaa_Mihgo+99 YagudoBeadNecklace x4     # 494 (200)
finish                                         # the mustZone
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # 89 (Event) under 517: 517
finish
quest Windurst.MihgosAmigo available           # GM
quest Windurst.CryingOverOnions accepted       # GM
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # 81 and 517 tie; 517 played last: 81
finish                                         # begun
quest Windurst.AsThickAsThieves accepted       # GM
trigger Cha_Lebagta                            # 85 (Event) under As Thick as Thieves' 507 (Progress): 507
finish
